(7710205, 1267016, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful display of your fabulous talent, Wendy!</td>', 'What a beautiful display of your fabulous talent, Wendy!', '2021-12-31 11:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710218, 1266994, 59737, '<td valign="top">Well lit and photographed, like the placement of the items with the one lens facing a different direction giving tension, each item has its own space but is part of the group.  Like the background the limited color palette and overall low key style of the image.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Well lit and photographed, like the placement of the items with the one lens facing a different direction giving tension, each item has its own space but is part of the group.  Like the background the limited color palette and overall low key style of the image.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710220, 1267028, 59737, '<td valign="top">Looks like my kids bed and reminds me of the scene in ET when he hides among the stuffed animals.  Nice lighting and a comfortable, loving scene.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like my kids bed and reminds me of the scene in ET when he hides among the stuffed animals.  Nice lighting and a comfortable, loving scene.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710221, 1267023, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice old looking fence, not sure where this scene is but imagining it covered in snow and it would make a great winter image.  Meets the challenge but not how I think most interpreted it.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Nice old looking fence, not sure where this scene is but imagining it covered in snow and it would make a great winter image.  Meets the challenge but not how I think most interpreted it.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710222, 1266763, 59737, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of 7up, sprite, ginger ale and coke.  Like the bands of green and how they move across the image.  Meets the challenge but for me nothing to really grab and hold my attention.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Makes me think of 7up, sprite, ginger ale and coke.  Like the bands of green and how they move across the image.  Meets the challenge but for me nothing to really grab and hold my attention.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710223, 1266997, 59737, '<td valign="top">would like to have seen more of these, I like the color arrangement and the curved presentation but would like to see more depth of bottles going back into the distance.  Maybe just a random pile of all the bottles would have worked well too.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'would like to have seen more of these, I like the color arrangement and the curved presentation but would like to see more depth of bottles going back into the distance.  Maybe just a random pile of all the bottles would have worked well too.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710224, 1266903, 59737, '<td valign="top">interesting angle somewhat disorienting, wish the focus was more on the toothbrush head and not the counter, would have made this stronger for me.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'interesting angle somewhat disorienting, wish the focus was more on the toothbrush head and not the counter, would have made this stronger for me.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710226, 1266979, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice bright popping colorswith similar colors in the background, reflected on a white background I''m guessing or even a mirror.  Nice sharpness and interesting reflections in their heads.  Best of luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Nice bright popping colorswith similar colors in the background, reflected on a white background I''m guessing or even a mirror.  Nice sharpness and interesting reflections in their heads.  Best of luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710227, 1266882, 59737, '<td valign="top">They are odd but interesting, think shooting this from their level and the front would make for a more interesting image but may not have been possible.  Teh first character with the chain ponytail especially I want to see more of.  Good luck</td>', 'They are odd but interesting, think shooting this from their level and the front would make for a more interesting image but may not have been possible.  Teh first character with the chain ponytail especially I want to see more of.  Good luck', '2021-12-31 15:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710228, 1266894, 59737, '<td valign="top">Like the tones and look of this, the haphazard look also works well for me. All the browns work well together.  Hope this does well for you good luck.</td>', 'Like the tones and look of this, the haphazard look also works well for me. All the browns work well together.  Hope this does well for you good luck.', '2021-12-31 15:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710229, 1267014, 59737, '<td valign="top">think if this were shot more on the level of the records and not looking up giving a stronger feel of being surrounded by the records this would have been stronger for me, the ceiling takes up a lot of space and doesn''t help the image for me.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'think if this were shot more on the level of the records and not looking up giving a stronger feel of being surrounded by the records this would have been stronger for me, the ceiling takes up a lot of space and doesn''t help the image for me.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710230, 1266998, 59737, '<td valign="top">Like the collection and the typesetters box, especially with the font still being called out on the pull.  Small happy memories all around and like the empty spaces and how items appear randomly placed. The one random key on the outside is a nice bonus. Good luck</td>', 'Like the collection and the typesetters box, especially with the font still being called out on the pull.  Small happy memories all around and like the empty spaces and how items appear randomly placed. The one random key on the outside is a nice bonus. Good luck', '2021-12-31 16:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710242, 1266860, 59737, '<td valign="top">Red Sox fan here and since you''ve got Yankees stuff got to give you a 1 (kidding).  Nice collection of items baseball makes from some great memories.  Nicely lit and displayed with lots of interest for a baseball fan.</td>', 'Red Sox fan here and since you''ve got Yankees stuff got to give you a 1 (kidding).  Nice collection of items baseball makes from some great memories.  Nicely lit and displayed with lots of interest for a baseball fan.', '2021-12-31 20:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710243, 1267016, 59737, '<td valign="top">great collection of images there, like that you''ve got them printed.  If it''s all your ribbon winners you''re going to need a lot of wall.  Remember seeing these in some challenges and being gobsmacked at the quality of the images.  The two top row center are favorites of mine and think I recall an image with someone shooting a flintlock that was a wow as well.  Good Luck with the challenge.</td>', 'great collection of images there, like that you''ve got them printed.  If it''s all your ribbon winners you''re going to need a lot of wall.  Remember seeing these in some challenges and being gobsmacked at the quality of the images.  The two top row center are favorites of mine and think I recall an image with someone shooting a flintlock that was a wow as well.  Good Luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 20:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7710244, 1267022, 59737, '<td valign="top">That light on the back wall is fantastic, remote flash shooting through a piece of glass maybe? The glass has some nice textures but can''t see it all with the darker colors, wish the glass was a little brighter. Really like the pieces overlapping on the left with the shapes and shades of color created.  My attention keeps getting split but I''m more focused on the background than the subject.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'That light on the back wall is fantastic, remote flash shooting through a piece of glass maybe? The glass has some nice textures but can''t see it all with the darker colors, wish the glass was a little brighter. Really like the pieces overlapping on the left with the shapes and shades of color created.  My attention keeps getting split but I''m more focused on the background than the subject.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2021-12-31 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
